[AS7's Practice Problem 12.10 (unbalanced, with power)]

e0a,0,ag,(220∠-120°)
eb0,bg,0,(220∠120°)
sla,ag,ad
slb,bg,bd
slc,0,cd
rab,ad,bd,-5j
